<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on Mascotech.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon on Mascotech.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst John Kirnan upgraded Mascotech Inc to buy from hold, saying the company could be among the best performers in the original equipment supplier industry in 1997.</p>
<p>-- In a report, the analyst said the shares could reach $21 in the next six to 12-months.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-3/8 to 18-1/8.</p>
</text>
